:"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25762-yuesidhe","name":"YueSidhe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-09T21:39:00-07:00","id":1456497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1444710-delusion-and-contempt-changeling-the-dreaming?p=1444968#post1444968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m just dropping in to say Harbingers of Winter should be released on Storytellers Vault this year. It might be relevant to the question at hand \ud83d\ude09</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I request elaboration and a more defined timeframe. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-10T19:31:55-07:00","id":1456571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1444710-delusion-and-contempt-changeling-the-dreaming?p=1456497#post1456497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I request elaboration and a more defined timeframe. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>The original timeframe was going to be this past December, but health issues hit several of the folks working on it pretty hard, myself included. It\u2019s close now, there\u2019s only one more final draft still outstanding. I\u2019ve hired an artist to do the cover art, and the final drafts I have in hand are getting an editing pass now. Once they\u2019ve all been through editing and I have all the art assets in hand, I\u2019ll put it all together in layout. The plan is to serialize the release \u2014 a chapter per month.<br /> <br /> As for more info, it\u2019s essentially a big book of bad guys for C20. It\u2019ll go into the social upheavals in changeling society with the Endless Winter imminent. It\u2019ll dive deeper into autumn people, Dauntain, Thallain, and the Black Court. It\u2019ll explore Dark Glamour and update the dark Arts for C20. It\u2019ll reintroduce the Fomorians for C20\u2019s status quo, and there\u2019ll be a few other surprises that I hope folks will like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-10T23:56:44-07:00","id":1456586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1444710-delusion-and-contempt-changeling-the-dreaming?p=1456571#post1456571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The original timeframe was going to be this past December, but health issues hit several of the folks working on it pretty hard, myself included. It\u2019s close now, there\u2019s only one more final draft still outstanding. I\u2019ve hired an artist to do the cover art, and the final drafts I have in hand are getting an editing pass now. Once they\u2019ve all been through editing and I have all the art assets in hand, I\u2019ll put it all together in layout. The plan is to serialize the release \u2014 a chapter per month.<br /> <br /> As for more info, it\u2019s essentially a big book of bad guys for C20. It\u2019ll go into the social upheavals in changeling society with the Endless Winter imminent. It\u2019ll dive deeper into autumn people, Dauntain, Thallain, and the Black Court. It\u2019ll explore Dark Glamour and update the dark Arts for C20. It\u2019ll reintroduce the Fomorians for C20\u2019s status quo, and there\u2019ll be a few other surprises that I hope folks will like.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nice! I'll pick it up when it drops. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}